# Trial by Wind (outlands 194), the quest's own var at the completion: accepted with the Whisper of Gales and
# Quest[5][194]Prog 1 (GMs). Agado-Pugado: 69; finished on 5: 10000 gil, Heir of the Great Wind, the whisper taken,
# TrialByWind_date set, San d'Oria and Bastok fame +30, the raw player:completeQuest. The raw completeQuest does no
# cleanup: Quest[5][194]Prog stays 1 (quest:complete's cleanup would clear it).
char zone=Rabao pos=-16.5,7.8,-10.5 job=WAR lvl=75
quest Outlands.TrialByWind accepted
keyitem WhisperOfGales
charvar Quest[5][194]Prog 1               # a GM: the quest's own var
login
trigger Agado-Pugado                      # accepted, the whisper: 69 (0, fork, 3, 0, 0)
finish option=5                           # 10000 gil; the title; the whisper taken; the date; fame +30 each; completed
